  "schema": "goav1-pr8-encoder-im6-benchmark-v1",
  "date": "2026-10-16",
  "decision": "Accept as a regular-kernel improvement only, subject to final validation already passed. Do not claim a whole-Pan speedup.",
  "change": "pred8IM skips exact-zero outer coefficients k[0] and k[7] in the horizontal intermediate pass. Regular/smooth and sharp phase 0 have zero outer taps and use six taps; fractional sharp filters retain the eight-tap path.",
  "scope_and_caveats": {
    "micro": "Direct pred8IM on cache-sized intermediate shapes (widths 24/40/72, rows 26/42/74, int16 intermediate stride 80); regular and sharp phase 8.",
    "whole_frame": "Single-thread 1920x1080 synthetic Pan benchmark, 31 measured P-frame encodes per sample; content is generated in video_bench_test.go (seed 15, blurred texture, 4-pixel shifts and constant chroma), not a corpus clip. GOAV1_BENCH_CORPUS_DIR was set but the benchmark does not read it.",
    "whole_frame_result": "Fresh 10-pair confirmation is neutral: 5/10 candidate wins and its paired bootstrap interval crosses zero. No whole-frame speed improvement is demonstrated.",
    "wrapper_issue": "An initial wrapper invocation failed before running benchmarks because Darwin confstr returned an I/O error for DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR. No samples came from it. The subsequent runs set CODEX_PROJECT_CACHE_ROOT explicitly and used the verified project-scoped cache."
